const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文提出源于公司实体投资决策的一类投资型资本资产定价模型。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article presents an investment-based class of capital-asset-pricing models that arises from firms' real investment decisions. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/eufm.12129",label:{zh:"European Financial Management (2017) · 来源说明",en:"European Financial Management (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它是连接投资政策、资本成本和经验收益模式的概念性资产定价综合，而非单一可观察的市场因子计算。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It is a conceptual asset-pricing synthesis linking investment policies, costs of capital, and empirical return patterns, not a single observed market-factor calculation. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/eufm.12129",label:{zh:"European Financial Management (2017) · 来源说明",en:"European Financial Management (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"经验实现需要时点投资、盈利和资产数据、收益序列、因子或模型设定、公司样本、日期和退出处理。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"An empirical implementation needs point-in-time investment, profitability and asset data, return series, factor or model specification, firm universe, dates, and treatment of exits. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/eufm.12129",label:{zh:"European Financial Management (2017) · 来源说明",en:"European Financial Management (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要将投资 CAPM 作为组织异象和投资行为的范式，并不证明某模型唯一具有因果性或普遍占优。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The abstract frames investment CAPM as a paradigm for organizing anomalies and investment behavior; it does not establish that a model is uniquely causal or universally dominant. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/eufm.12129",label:{zh:"European Financial Management (2017) · 来源说明",en:"European Financial Management (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"明确模型方程和假设；保留投资与会计定义、信息时点、因子构造、样本选择和全部竞争设定。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"State the model equations and assumptions; preserve investment and accounting definitions, information timing, factor construction, sample selection, and all competing specifications. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/eufm.12129",label:{zh:"European Financial Management (2017) · 来源说明",en:"European Financial Management (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 European Financial Management (2017)。理论范式不是实时因子源、估值引擎，也不保证历史异象在成本和市场变化后继续存在。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites European Financial Management (2017). A theoretical paradigm is not a live factor feed, valuation engine, or guarantee that historical anomaly patterns will persist after costs and market changes. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/eufm.12129",label:{zh:"European Financial Management (2017) · 来源说明",en:"European Financial Management (2017) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Investment CAPM”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。理论范式不是实时因子源、估值引擎，也不保证历史异象在成本和市场变化后继续存在。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Investment CAPM”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
